Third-party libraries used at build and run time (not included here)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

Declared in deps.edn and fetched by the Clojure CLI; each is distributed under
its own license, which binary releases reproduce: the build writes
licenses/THIRD-PARTY-<binary>.txt from the resolved dependencies (each
library, its declared license and the license files it ships). They include
Clojure and its contrib libraries (EPL-1.0), malli (EPL-2.0) and http-kit
(Apache-2.0).

FFmpeg is not part of this program. It runs as a separate executable. Release
downloads bundle a pinned FFmpeg build in bin/, licensed under the GNU GPL
version 3 or later; its license and a note on its exact archives and source
code are in licenses/ffmpeg/.
